section.content:
  Section 117 of the Federal Water Pollution Control Act (33 U.S.C. 1267) is amended by striking subsection (j) and inserting the following:“(j) 
Time periods.Authorization of Appropriations.—There are authorized to be appropriated to carry out this section—“(1) for fiscal year 2021, $90,000,000;
“(2) for fiscal year 2022, $90,500,000;
“(3) for fiscal year 2023, $91,000,000;
“(4) for fiscal year 2024, $91,500,000; and
“(5) for fiscal year 2025, $92,000,000.”

.
